BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:9elHp4XEmuTQfladcHQN@ccom-dashboard
SUMMARY:Donation Drive for Hope
LOCATION:Sign in to download the location
DESCRIPTION:AAWP is hosting a donation drive to support Hope Women's Shelter and provide essential items to women and teen girls facing crisis situations. Community members are encouraged to donate new\, full-sized\, unused personal care and household items\, including shampoo\, conditioner\, body wash\, lotion\, toothpaste\, toilet paper\, paper towels\, disinfectant cleaning wipes\, and women’s and children’s underwear.\n\nDonations will be collected from November 2–12\, 2026\, with a final drop-off deadline of November 12. Every donation helps provide women and teen girls with essential resources while supporting their journey toward strength\, stability\, and support.\nThank you for helping us give back to our community and support Hope’s mission!\n---\nEvent Details: https://mwustudentlife.midwestern.edu/rsvp?id=377735
DTSTART:20261102T150000Z
DTEND:20261112T220000Z
END:VEVENT
